1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 19=

8
00:00:47,939 --> 00:00:49,399
Let go of me! Let me go!

9
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:52,420
T-T-The Young Master is alive!

10
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:14,700
Wasn't I on a bridge?

11
00:01:15,659 --> 00:01:18,140
A bridge? What bridge?

12
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:22,299
A very, very long bridge,

13
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,420
spanning across a river.

14
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:28,859
There were so many people on the bridge,

15
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,840
and so many in the river too.

16
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,019
The Naihe Bridge...

17
00:01:39,299 --> 00:01:42,000
My son, you're back!

18
00:01:43,739 --> 00:01:44,780
Great!

19
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,799
I'm so glad!

20
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,879
Young Master is back!

21
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:52,180
Ladies...

22
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:55,519
No, our saviors...

23
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,879
I was such a fool.

24
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,500
I was so blind

25
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,099
that offended you two.

26
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,340
Please accept my apology.

27
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:03,359
Please don't. Rise, please.

28
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,379
We understand your caring

29
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,480
to your son.

30
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:08,659
It's a good thing
that Lord Liang is alive now.

31
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,960
It's all thanks to Miss Su.

32
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,439
Despite my objections,

33
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:20,819
she fed you
Master Zhao's miraculous elixir

34
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,500
to save you.

35
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,300
Miss Su, thank you

36
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,960
for saving my life.

37
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,400
Don't mention it.

38
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:34,379
But anyway,
you are an imperial official.

39
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:37,280
Who would dare harm you?

40
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,680
Shanbo,

41
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,580
Father has betrothed me

42
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,159
to the son

43
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:51,180
of Prime Minister.

44
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:54,479
I will marry him in three days.

45
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:59,199
Yingnan, I'll go beg
Governor right away.

46
00:02:59,659 --> 00:03:00,800
My rank may be low,

47
00:03:01,259 --> 00:03:04,120
but my love for you is sincere.

48
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
It's useless.

49
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,759
Father won't agree.

50
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:13,000
He wants to use my marriage

51
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,400
to please Prime Minister.

52
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:18,439
I'll never let you marry
that spoiled scum.

53
00:03:18,539 --> 00:03:21,139
Shanbo, let's run away,

54
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,319
to the ends of the earth.

55
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:23,759
Just stick together forever.

56
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:25,879
All right, I'll take you away right now.

57
00:03:30,979 --> 00:03:31,979
Father.

58
00:03:31,979 --> 00:03:33,979
You're going nowhere.

59
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,639
My lord,

60
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:40,460
Yingnan and I love each other

61
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:41,960
and have privately pledged
ourselves to each other.

62
00:03:42,259 --> 00:03:44,000
I beg you to grant us your blessing.

63
00:03:44,659 --> 00:03:47,159
I will never mistreat
Yingnan in this life.

64
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:50,560
Who do you think you are?
How dare you covet my daughter?

65
00:03:51,020 --> 00:03:53,460
Men, beat him to death!

66
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,840
No!

67
00:03:56,419 --> 00:03:57,419
Mother,

68
00:03:57,620 --> 00:04:00,139
Yingnan is still under house arrest.

69
00:04:00,219 --> 00:04:02,639
She must be suffering so much.

70
00:04:03,699 --> 00:04:05,900
They've gone too far!

71
00:04:06,379 --> 00:04:07,379
Lord Liang,

72
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:11,460
your love for Miss Zhu runs deep,

73
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:15,240
but Lord Zhu
is a high-ranking official after all.

74
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:18,199
I'm afraid this can't be solved easily.

75
00:04:19,779 --> 00:04:22,000
That shameless Lord Zhu!

76
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:25,040
That tyrannical Prime Minister!

77
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:28,899
Lord Liang, you can't
let your suffering go in vain.

78
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:31,819
And you can't just
swallow this injustice!

79
00:04:33,819 --> 00:04:34,819
Shanbo,

80
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,459
cut all ties with Yingnan.

81
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,560
You two belong to different worlds.

82
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:42,980
Mother,

83
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:47,000
Yingnan and I swore
to be together forever.

84
00:04:47,459 --> 00:04:49,800
She is a woman of unyielding integrity.

85
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:51,839
I know

86
00:04:52,379 --> 00:04:55,759
she would rather die
than marry anyone else.

87
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:01,399
You already died once.

88
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:03,680
You owe her nothing.

89
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:07,480
Mother, I cannot do it.

90
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:11,620
I'd rather die
than see Yingnan get hurt.

91
00:05:14,819 --> 00:05:16,579
What a tragedy!

92
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:25,160
My lady, Prefect's wife is here.

93
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,759
Liang Shanbo,

94
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:44,579
our entire clan is against
you and Yingnan being together.

95
00:05:45,500 --> 00:05:46,600
If you are sensible enough,

96
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,439
write Yingnan a letter

97
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,199
to cut all ties with her.

98
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:55,920
No way. I will never write it.

99
00:05:56,699 --> 00:05:57,699
It's not up to you.

100
00:05:58,259 --> 00:05:59,959
An ant daring to go against the heavens?

101
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,759
If you insist on holding on,

102
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:06,860
your Liang family can't even
withstand the wrath of the Zhu family,

103
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,500
let alone Prime Minister.

104
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,240
Dragging down your mother is unfilial.

105
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:15,540
Making the people
lose an honest official

106
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,379
is unfaithful.

107
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:20,000
Ruining Yingnan's reputation

108
00:06:20,300 --> 00:06:21,639
is dishonorable.

109
00:06:21,939 --> 00:06:24,439
Do you still have the nerve
to stay here?

110
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,759
Madam Zhu,

111
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:32,759
Lord Liang and Miss Zhu
truly love each other.

112
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,839
Tearing them apart will only
bring them a lifetime of misery.

113
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:39,139
My lady, Lord Liang is upright,

114
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:40,420
diligent, and caring.

115
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,939
He will surely have a bright future.

116
00:06:46,259 --> 00:06:47,800
Who are you

117
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,100
to meddle in our Zhu family's affairs?

118
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,899
Can true love make money?

119
00:06:52,459 --> 00:06:54,459
Can it secure our family's
prosperous future?

120
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:56,500
The Prime Minister's pedigree
is something

121
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,759
Liang Shanbo couldn't reach
in ten lifetimes.

122
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,420
Upright? Diligent?

123
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:05,420
In officialdom,
these are the most worthless traits.

124
00:07:05,639 --> 00:07:06,639
Without family backing

125
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:07,639
or significant status,

126
00:07:08,019 --> 00:07:11,860
he can only be an ant
for others to crush at will.

127
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:16,860
You two women of lowly status

128
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,240
have no say here.

129
00:07:19,579 --> 00:07:22,300
Say another word,
and I'll have your tongues cut out.

130
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,560
You!

131
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:33,079
Ants should know their place.

132
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:36,399
Failing to figure that out
only ruins everyone.

133
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:39,699
Giving up is the best solution.

134
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:43,740
Liang Shanbo,
if you can't figure that out,

135
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:45,600
don't drag Yingnan down with you.

136
00:07:46,259 --> 00:07:48,600
Your worthless life is nothing
compared to hers.

137
00:07:50,379 --> 00:07:53,480
Shanbo, just give up.

138
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,519
I'm begging you.

139
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:01,899
Liang Shanbo, do you want
to drive Yingnan to her death?

140
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:09,379
Shanbo.

141
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,199
Don't blame me for being heartless.

142
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:17,240
Yingnan refuses to eat or drink,

143
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,079
fighting a futile battle.

144
00:08:19,639 --> 00:08:20,920
Do you want her to die?

145
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,300
Don't you love her?

146
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,160
Can you give up everything for her?

147
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,180
You must write

148
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:28,300
this breakup letter.

149
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,940
Fine, I'll write it.

150
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,500
Shanbo.

151
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:53,860
Shanbo.

152
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,480
Shanbo.

153
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,320
Shanbo.

154
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:01,240
Cruel to the core!

155
00:09:01,419 --> 00:09:02,779
She's gone too far!

156
00:09:04,860 --> 00:09:06,779
Lord Liang is so pitiful.

157
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:10,480
He must be heartbroken.

158
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:14,360
No. His heart has already broken.

159
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,460
If Dong could help them...

160
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,360
Dong is powerful,

161
00:09:22,259 --> 00:09:26,240
yet he still can't overcome
the family status prejudice.

162
00:09:26,919 --> 00:09:27,919
Darlings.

163
00:09:44,653 --> 00:09:48,244
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

164
00:09:48,244 --> 00:09:51,031
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

165
00:09:51,607 --> 00:09:53,769
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

166
00:09:53,769 --> 00:09:56,615
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

167
00:09:56,615 --> 00:09:59,893
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

168
00:09:59,893 --> 00:10:01,527
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

169
00:10:01,527 --> 00:10:03,591
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

170
00:10:03,591 --> 00:10:05,127
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

171
00:10:05,127 --> 00:10:07,909
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

172
00:10:08,358 --> 00:10:10,263
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

173
00:10:10,263 --> 00:10:16,294
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

174
00:10:16,876 --> 00:10:20,759
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

175
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:23,984
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

176
00:10:24,496 --> 00:10:27,095
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

177
00:10:27,095 --> 00:10:32,223
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

178
00:10:32,223 --> 00:10:35,751
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

179
00:10:35,751 --> 00:10:39,459
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

180
00:10:39,459 --> 00:10:41,351
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

181
00:10:41,351 --> 00:10:43,428
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

182
00:10:43,428 --> 00:10:45,959
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

183
00:10:45,959 --> 00:10:49,996
♪You met the most precious person♪

184
00:10:51,664 --> 00:10:53,527
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

185
00:10:53,527 --> 00:10:56,046
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

186
00:10:56,046 --> 00:10:57,495
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

187
00:10:57,495 --> 00:10:59,797
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

188
00:10:59,797 --> 00:11:01,767
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

189
00:11:01,767 --> 00:11:06,177
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

190
00:11:06,177 --> 00:11:07,719
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

191
00:11:07,719 --> 00:11:09,629
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

192
00:11:09,629 --> 00:11:12,903
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

193
00:11:12,903 --> 00:11:16,224
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

194
00:11:16,224 --> 00:11:17,959
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

195
00:11:17,959 --> 00:11:22,583
♪Just catch your breath first♪

196
00:11:22,583 --> 00:11:26,333
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

197
00:11:26,333 --> 00:11:29,711
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

198
00:11:30,085 --> 00:11:32,055
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

199
00:11:32,055 --> 00:11:37,802
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

200
00:11:37,802 --> 00:11:41,318
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

201
00:11:41,318 --> 00:11:42,887
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

202
00:11:42,887 --> 00:11:45,197
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

203
00:11:45,197 --> 00:11:46,935
♪From laughter to devotion♪

204
00:11:46,935 --> 00:11:48,991
♪From falling to innocence♪

205
00:11:48,991 --> 00:11:50,839
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

206
00:11:50,839 --> 00:11:57,509
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
